{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  ak-notebook-drawer.liquid  —  SHARED notebook mobile-drawer styling host
  ============================================================
  STAGE ND-2A — NOTEBOOK MOBILE DRAWER FONT PASS (font-only).

  Purpose:
    The mobile MENU drawer is owned by sections/ak-top.liquid and is the
    SAME shared component on every page that includes ak-top (~31 templates,
    incl. dark/non-notebook routes). Its link + trigger text is the old
    Impact stack. This snippet moves ONLY that text to the notebook
    'AK Due Date' voice, and ONLY on the 9 notebook surfaces — leaving the
    dark routes (and the homepage, which has no ak-top) on Impact.

  Why a separate shared snippet (not edits to ak-top.liquid):
    - ak-top.liquid (and its single header/nav/cart/menu/drawer/particle IIFE)
      must NOT be touched (known-fragile-areas.md). All notebook nav restyling
      is page-scoped CSS done OUTSIDE that file.
    - The drawer JS relocates .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer] to be a direct
      child of <body>; the notebook page class lives on <html>; therefore
      `html.<page-class> .ak-top-drawer a` reaches the relocated drawer.
    - Every selector below is prefixed by a notebook page class, so this block
      is inherently leak-safe: dark routes carry no notebook class and are
      untouched. The @font-face is declared here so 'AK Due Date' is available
      on all 9 routes (the existing face is only rendered on /pages/mystery-box).

  Rendered once (additively) from each of the 9 notebook host snippets via
  `{% render 'ak-notebook-drawer' %}`. No class hook of its own (CSS only).

  Scope of THIS pass — font-family ONLY. Does NOT change:
    size / letter-spacing / line-height / spacing / color / background /
    active state / transform / transition / z-index / width / height /
    display / positioning / markup / JS / open-close / scroll-lock / aria.
    Does NOT touch the close ✕ (.ak-top-drawer-close is a <button>, never
    matched by `.ak-top-drawer a`) nor the BAD/CandyFacts PNG image links
    (.ak-top-mobile-image, explicitly excluded via :not()).

  Revert: delete this file + the 9 `{% render 'ak-notebook-drawer' %}` lines.
  ============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  /* ============================================================
     STAGE ND-2A — NOTEBOOK MOBILE DRAWER FONT PASS
     Self-hosted display voice (same asset/face the other notebook
     pages use). Reuses assets/ak-due-date.woff2 — no new asset.
     ============================================================ */
  @font-face{
    font-family: 'AK Due Date';
    src: url('{{ 'ak-due-date.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  /* Font-only swap of the MENU trigger label + the drawer TEXT links from
     Impact to 'AK Due Date', scoped to each notebook page class. The drawer
     is body-appended at runtime but <html> is still an ancestor, so these
     html.<class> selectors reach it. Image links (.ak-top-mobile-image) are
     excluded so the BAD/CandyFacts PNG links are never treated as text; the
     close ✕ is a <button>, so `.ak-top-drawer a` never matches it. Nothing
     other than font-family is set here. */
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-mobile-trigger,
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-mobile-trigger,
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-mobile-trigger,
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-mobile-trigger,
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-mobile-trigger,
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-mobile-trigger,
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-mobile-trigger,
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-mobile-trigger,
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-mobile-trigger,
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image){
    font-family:'AK Due Date', Impact, Haettenschweiler, 'Arial Narrow Bold', sans-serif !important;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------
     320px overflow correction (sanctioned by ND-2A plan step 8).
     Runtime QA at 320px: 'AK Due Date' is slightly wider than the
     old Impact, so the two longest drawer labels overflowed their
     link box — LIFE/STYLE (scrollWidth 307 > clientWidth 298) and
     NARRATIVE (305 > 298); the shorter labels fit. 375px and 390px
     are clear (no overflow). Smallest correction: tighten tracking
     on the notebook drawer TEXT links ONLY, on small screens ONLY
     (<=360px), from the drawer's inherited .22em down to .16em.
     This returns every label to scrollWidth <= clientWidth with
     ~10px margin. NO font-size change; tap targets are unchanged
     (~90px). The MENU trigger ("MENU", 4 chars) never overflows and
     keeps its inherited spacing. Letter-spacing at >=375px is also
     left untouched (no overflow there). */
  @media (max-width:360px){
    html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
    html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
    html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
    html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
    html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
    html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
    html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
    html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
    html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image){
      letter-spacing:.16em !important;
    }
  }

  /* ============================================================
     STAGE ND-2B — NOTEBOOK MOBILE DRAWER PAPER / INK PASS
     Repaints the drawer PANEL + its text/controls into the notebook
     legal-pad look, on the 9 notebook surfaces ONLY. Builds on the
     ND-2A font pass (font-family + 320 tracking are untouched here).
     CSS-ONLY, page-class-scoped (leak-safe), NO markup/JS/motion change.
     `sections/ak-top.liquid` is NOT edited; the drawer is body-appended
     and the class is on <html>, so html.<class> .ak-top-drawer reaches it.
     House values reused: paper #f5dd4f, ink #15120b, purple #ff33ff,
     red rule rgba(218,40,50,*), blue rule rgba(44,120,180,*), 32px ruling.
     ============================================================ */

  /* (1) PANEL — legal-pad paper. Beats the drawer's own
     `background:#000 !important` (0,2,0) with a (0,3,1) page-class +
     attribute selector + !important. A thin red LEFT margin rule (~28px)
     + subtle blue horizontal ruled lines; yellow base. Layout untouched
     (position/inset/z-index/transform/opacity/transition/overflow/flex/
     padding all inherited from ak-top.liquid). background-color +
     background-image longhands override the #000 shorthand per-property. */
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer],
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer],
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer],
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer],
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer],
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer],
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer],
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer],
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer[data-ak-top-drawer]{
    background-color:#f5dd4f !important;            /* pale legal-pad yellow */
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg,
        transparent 27px,
        rgba(218,40,50,.55) 27px,
        rgba(218,40,50,.55) 29px,
        transparent 29px),                          /* red LEFT margin rule */
      repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,
        transparent 0 31px,
        rgba(44,120,180,.30) 31px 32px) !important; /* subtle blue ruled lines */
    background-repeat:no-repeat, repeat !important;
    background-position:0 0, 0 0 !important;
    background-size:auto, auto !important;
  }

  /* (2) TEXT LINKS — ink on paper. Drops the white-on-black 3D grey
     text-shadow from ak-top.liquid (looks muddy on yellow). font-family
     (ND-2A) + size + letter-spacing are NOT restated → preserved. */
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image){
    color:#15120b !important;          /* ink */
    text-shadow:none !important;       /* remove dark-drawer 3D shadow */
  }

  /* (3) HOVER / FOCUS — on-brand purple feedback + a subtle ink wash
     (replaces ak-top.liquid's invisible white tint). */
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):hover,
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):hover,
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):hover,
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):hover,
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):hover,
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):hover,
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):hover,
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):hover,
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):hover,
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible{
    color:#ff33ff !important;                 /* official purple */
    background:rgba(21,18,11,.07) !important;  /* subtle ink wash */
  }

  /* (4) ACTIVE LINK — clearly current: purple text + a faint magenta
     highlighter pill + a subtle ink shadow so it reads on yellow.
     Equal specificity to (3); ordered AFTER so active wins at rest. */
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer a.active:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer a.active:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer a.active:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer a.active:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer a.active:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer a.active:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer a.active:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer a.active:not(.ak-top-mobile-image),
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer a.active:not(.ak-top-mobile-image){
    color:#ff33ff !important;
    background:rgba(255,51,255,.12) !important;        /* highlighter pill */
    text-shadow:0 1px 1px rgba(21,18,11,.22) !important;
  }

  /* (5) CLOSE ✕ — ink (was white-on-black), purple on hover/focus.
     NOT given AK Due Date (it stays its system glyph). Behaviour
     (background:none / border:none / :active scale) untouched. */
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close,
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close,
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close,
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close,
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close,
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close,
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close,
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close,
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close{
    color:#15120b !important;
  }
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:hover,
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:hover,
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:hover,
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:hover,
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:hover,
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:hover,
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:hover,
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:hover,
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:hover,
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible{
    color:#ff33ff !important;
  }

  /* (6) FOCUS-VISIBLE a11y ring — keep keyboard focus obvious on paper
     (ink ring) for both the text links and the close button. */
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible,
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer a:not(.ak-top-mobile-image):focus-visible,
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-drawer-close:focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid #15120b !important;
    outline-offset:2px !important;
  }

  /* (7) IMAGE LINKS — keep the BAD / CandyFacts PNGs as IMAGES (never
     text). QA at 390/375/320 showed the BAD wordmark is WHITE and washes
     out on the yellow paper (CandyFacts has dark outlines and reads fine).
     Add a tiny ink contour drop-shadow so both logos read as stickers on
     the page. PAINT-ONLY: height / transition / the `:active` transform
     scale in ak-top.liquid are NOT touched — no resize, no conversion to
     text, no new asset. `filter` is purely additive (base sets none). */
  html.ak-products-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-mobile-image img,
  html.ak-lifestyle-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-mobile-image img,
  html.ak-clubhub-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-mobile-image img,
  html.ak-narrative-page      .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-mobile-image img,
  html.ak-badmusic-page       .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-mobile-image img,
  html.ak-badmusic-2025-page  .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-mobile-image img,
  html.ak-archive-page        .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-mobile-image img,
  html.ak-cart-page           .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-mobile-image img,
  html.ak-mysterybox-page     .ak-top-drawer .ak-top-mobile-image img{
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 1px rgba(21,18,11,1)) drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(21,18,11,.55)) !important;
  }
</style>
